0006 — classlink.rs build_class: do_inherit_property readonly/set-visibility
rules (apply after 0001-0005).

* "Cannot redeclare (non-)readonly property ..." is not raised when the
  parent property is abstract (a hooked abstract property may be
  implemented by a readonly one), as in php-src do_inherit_property.
* Child set visibility must be the parent's or weaker: the parent's set
  visibility, or (without one) its visibility mapped to the set level;
  a get-only virtual parent has none. Otherwise "Set access level of
  %s::$%s must be %s (as in class %s)%s" with private(set)/protected(set)/
  omitted and " or weaker" when the parent declared a set visibility.

Fixes: Zend/tests/asymmetric_visibility/override_{private_public,
protected_private,public_private,public_protected};
Zend/tests/readonly_props/readonly_with_default_abstract_get_set_implicit_set.

